<title>USA: Carson Inc says ends acquisition talks.</title>
<headline>Carson Inc says ends acquisition talks.</headline>
<dateline>SAVANNAH, Georgia 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carson Inc said on Thursday it had terminated negotiations involving the proposed acquisition of Black Like Me Products Ltd, a South African company.</p>
<p>The talks were with Carson's 75 percent-owned South African subsidiary, Carson Holdings Ltd, it said.</p>
<p>Carson, which manufactures and markets ethnic hair care products, did not say why talks were terminated. It could not be reached immediately for comment.</p>
</text>
